<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="st-dynamic-942-6"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">We are excited to launch Flywire’s new Client Resource Centre!</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #147bd1;"><strong>What’s new?</strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><strong>Client Resource Centre (</strong><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://help.flywire.com/hc/en-us/p/client_edu_uk?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>TIP: BOOKMARK THIS!</u></strong></span></a><strong>):</strong> This centralised hub houses all essential support offerings, making it easier to find what you need. You can access it via this <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://help.flywire.com/hc/en-us/p/client_edu_uk?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>direct link</u></strong></span></a> or through: the 'Help &amp; Support’ tab if you have the Flywire dashboard OR, under the ’Support’ tab if you have the Extranet.</li> 
<li><strong>My Support Tickets</strong>: Manage, view and track all your support inquiries in one place. View My Support Tickets <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://help.flywire.com/hc/en-us/requests?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>here</u></strong></span></a>.</li> 
<li><strong>Virtual Assistant:</strong> Get quick and personalised support for all your queries - you can access it via the Client Resource Centre.</li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #147bd1;"><strong>How to access ‘My Support Tickets’<span style="color: #147bd1;">? </span></strong><span style="color: #223341;">(login required)</span></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />This area is password-protected. To create a login, please follow:</p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Enter your work email address and create a password <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywiresupport.zendesk.com/auth/v2/login/password_reset?auth_origin=687529%2Ctrue%2Ctrue&amp;brand_id=687529&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fhelp.flywire.com%2Fhc%2Fen-us%2Frequests&amp;theme=hc&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>here</u></strong></span></a> (Continue below for step 2. Note it may take up to 5 minutes for the follow up email to come through.)</li> 
<li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Login using the details you set up in step 1, by using this URL: <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://help.flywire.com/hc/en-us/requests?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter">https://help.flywire.com/hc/en-us/requests</a>.</li> 
<li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Once logged in, you’ll see the ‘My Support Tickets’ area.</li> 
</ul> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="minw-158 hover-green" style="width: 100%;">
